WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.188
Lab 1 needs only a laptop
with PowerShell 7 and Pester.

2
00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:07.976
First you run Learn's own pause
and resume scripts against a fake

3
00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:11.550
tenant with two groups, one of
them already paused for review.

4
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:15.875
After the resume, both are on:
the held group came back to life.

5
00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.050
Try an unknown cloud name and
you'll see it sign in to worldwide.

6
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.925
Then you lint Book 3's table and evaluate
a rule over the fictional people.

7
00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:27.666
The disabled account
and the guest stay out,

8
00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:30.770
and the lower-case code gets
in, just as Learn says.
